# AchieveNest Branding

- Formal product identity must render through `AchieveNestLogo`.
- Shared shell brand areas must render through `BrandLockup` or `AchieveNestLogo`.
- Do not manually reconstruct the AchieveNest wordmark with text beside a mark.
- Do not create workspace- or role-specific AchieveNest logos.
- Do not recolor, distort, filter, shadow, crop, or alter the official artwork.
- Keep workspace labels and institutional identity separate from product branding.
- Do not import raw brand SVGs into ordinary UI pages; use the shared components. Document/export infrastructure may import an approved asset when component rendering is impossible.
- Keep sentence-level references such as “Welcome to AchieveNest” as text.
